<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIA TAKE 3-0 WINNING LEAD OVER MOROCCO IN DAVIS CUP I.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIA TAKE 3-0 WINNING LEAD OVER MOROCCO IN DAVIS CUP I.</headline>
<dateline>OSIJEK, Croatia 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia took a winning 3-0</p>
<p>lead over Morocco in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one</p>
<p>first round tie after winning the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Sasa Hirszon/Goran Ivanisevic beat Karim Alami/ Hachim Arazi</p>
<p>6-2 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
